							<blockquote
							class="quote-wrapper before:bg-gray before:bg-opacity-20 after:bg-gray after:bg-opacity-20 relative col-span-12 mt-10 py-6 before:absolute before:bottom-0 before:-left-6 before:h-10 before:w-1.25 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:-left-4.75 after:h-1.25 after:w-8.75 md:mt-0 md:px-0 lg:col-span-3 lg:col-start-10 lg:mt-0"
						>
							<p class="text-xl text-white">
								&#8220;My favorite memories of NDSCS are definitely the friends I made in my classes. We pushed each other out of our comfort zones and encouraged growth. After I graduated, I was so grateful for all the hands on learning I got in my program because I could use it in my career as a tool to be one step ahead.&#8221;
							</p>
